---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="About the Project | BitsNotes" 
  description="The story behind BitsNotes — from personal study notes to a notes sharing platform for everyone."
  keywords="about bitsnotes, lecture notes project, free study materials, educational platform"
  robots="index, follow"
>
  <Fragment slot="head">
    <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify({
      "@context": "https://schema.org",
      "@type": "AboutPage",
      "name": "The Story of BitsNotes",
      "description": "From personal study notes to a community-driven notes sharing platform.",
      "url": "https://bitsnotes.com/about"
    })} />
  </Fragment>

  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12 md:py-16 flex-grow">
    <header class="mb-10">
      <h1 class="font-display text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold text-[var(--text)] tracking-tight leading-tight">
        How BitsNotes Came to Be
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-2 text-[var(--text-muted)] text-lg">
        One student&rsquo;s struggle became a resource for many.
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="space-y-8">
      <section class="space-y-4 text-[var(--text)] leading-relaxed">
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-[var(--text)]">The Problem</h2>
        <p>
          I am not the kind of person who likes to read much, especially educational content. When I started with my AI and ML course, I found it very difficult to read through multiple sources trying to understand a single topic. Plus, the benefits of reading each new source were marginal.
        </p>

        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-[var(--text)] pt-4">A Personal Solution</h2>
        <p>
          So, I decided to create comprehensive notes for myself, with my own lecture notes as a base and then enriching them with what I learned from different reference material or study guides. And it worked pretty well for me.
        </p>

        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-[var(--text)] pt-4">Sharing the Discovery</h2>
        <p>
          But these notes stayed with me, offline. As I discussed this with my teammates and fellow students, I found that they too faced similar issues and showed interest in these notes.
        </p>

        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-[var(--text)] pt-4">The Birth of BitsNotes</h2>
        <p>
          So, I started bitsnotes.com as a notes sharing platform with a simple notes parser. With feedback and support, I've improved on the website to create this platform that I am proud of.
        </p>

        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-[var(--text)] pt-4">The Vision Ahead</h2>
        <p>
          I wish to continue improving and add more subjects where possible. I would also request you to contribute to this project and help expand the selection of subjects available.
        </p>
        <a href="https://github.com/tanmay-nemade01/bitsnotes" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 mt-2 px-5 py-2.5 rounded-[var(--r-md)] bg-[var(--accent)] text-white font-display font-semibold text-sm hover:opacity-90 transition-opacity">
          <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path d="M12 0C5.37 0 0 5.37 0 12c0 5.31 3.435 9.795 8.205 11.385.6.105.825-.255.825-.57 0-.285-.015-1.23-.015-2.235-3.015.555-3.795-.735-4.035-1.41-.135-.345-.72-1.41-1.23-1.695-.42-.225-1.02-.78-.015-.795.945-.015 1.62.87 1.845 1.23 1.08 1.815 2.805 1.305 3.495.99.105-.78.42-1.305.765-1.605-2.67-.3-5.46-1.335-5.46-5.925 0-1.305.465-2.385 1.23-3.225-.12-.3-.54-1.53.12-3.18 0 0 1.005-.315 3.3 1.23.96-.27 1.98-.405 3-.405s2.04.135 3 .405c2.295-1.56 3.3-1.23 3.3-1.23.66 1.65.24 2.88.12 3.18.765.84 1.23 1.905 1.23 3.225 0 4.605-2.805 5.625-5.475 5.925.435.375.81 1.095.81 2.22 0 1.605-.015 2.895-.015 3.3 0 .315.225.69.825.57A12.02 12.02 0 0024 12c0-6.63-5.37-12-12-12z"/>
          </svg>
          Contribute on GitHub
        </a>

        <div class="my-8 p-6 border-l-4 border-[var(--accent)] rounded-[var(--r-md)] bg-[var(--bg-elevated)]">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <div class="text-[var(--accent)] shrink-0 mt-1">
              <svg class="w-8 h-8" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path d="M14.017 21v-7.391c0-5.704 3.731-9.57 8.983-10.609l.995 2.151c-2.432.917-3.995 3.638-3.995 5.849h4v10H14.017zM0 21v-7.391c0-5.704 3.748-9.57 9-10.609l.996 2.151C7.563 6.068 6 8.789 6 11h4v10H0z"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <p class="text-base text-[var(--text)] leading-relaxed italic font-serif">
                &ldquo;So, I decided to create comprehensive notes for myself, with my own lecture notes as a base and then enriching them with what I learned from different reference material or study guides. And it worked pretty well for me.&rdquo;
              </p>
              <p class="mt-3 text-sm font-display font-semibold text-[var(--accent)]">&mdash; Why I&rsquo;m Building This</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 pt-6 border-t border-[var(--border)]">
        <div class="p-5 border border-[var(--border)] rounded-[var(--r-md)]">
          <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-[var(--r-sm)] bg-[var(--accent-subtle)] flex items-center justify-center text-[var(--accent)] mb-3">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h4 class="font-bold text-sm text-[var(--text)]">Blazing Fast</h4>
          <p class="text-xs text-[var(--text-muted)] mt-1 leading-relaxed">Powered by edge workers and R2 for rapid page rendering.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-5 border border-[var(--border)] rounded-[var(--r-md)]">
          <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-[var(--r-sm)] bg-[var(--accent-subtle)] flex items-center justify-center text-[var(--accent)] mb-3">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path d="M9.663 17h4.673M12 3v1m6.364 1.636l-.707.707M21 12h-1M4 12H3m3.343-5.657l-.707-.707m2.828 9.9a5 5 0 117.072 0l-.548.547A3.374 3.374 0 0014 18.469V19a2 2 0 11-4 0v-.531c0-.895-.356-1.754-.988-2.386l-.548-.547z"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h4 class="font-bold text-sm text-[var(--text)]">Study Aids</h4>
          <p class="text-xs text-[var(--text-muted)] mt-1 leading-relaxed">Integrated core concepts, breakdowns, and practice quizzes on pages.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
